			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:10,000",
				"to": "00:01:14,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 70000,
				"to": 74000
			},
			"text": " And I'm talking about, by being secretive, I'm talking about not even having your own website, okay?"
