				"from": "00:01:14,000",
				"to": "00:01:24,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 74000,
				"to": 84000
			},
			"text": " I guess there's a difference. You can do it between no social media presence at all in any way, shape or form and just having a dedicated professional website that shows off your projects."
