				"to": "00:02:11,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 124000,
				"to": 131000
			},
			"text": " Keir Silverbrook owned the company and it was a flat architecture. It was Keir Silverbrook, probably his right-hand man and everyone else."
